{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect custom split-feature section based entirely on the visual layout, spacing, and copy structure shown in the reference images "image_83e611.jpg" and "image_83e610.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the current theme's typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard layout maximum width rules (e.g., matching your storefront's `.page-width` or `.container` layout wrappers), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop screens, the section displays a balanced 2-column layout (Left Column: Bold Copy & Description; Right Column: Mock UI Interface Card Container). On mobile viewports, the layout must stack vertically with the right column sliding cleanly underneath the left column.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    
    ### 2. Left Column Layout (Text Copy Block)
    - **Top Badge Content:** A small, pill-shaped badge displaying the text "FLOW AI". 
      - Background: A very light, soft pastel lime-green background wash.
      - Text Color: A distinct olive/lime green accent color.
      - Border-Radius: 20px.
    - **Main Heading:** "店舗データと社内ルールを、\nFlow AIに聞く。" 
      - Formatting: Large, bold, deep navy blue text with a distinct line break as shown in the image to maintain editorial structure.
    - **Body Text Paragraph:** A smaller paragraph positioned below the heading using a muted slate-gray or dark-navy text color with proper line-height to ensure the Japanese text is highly legible:
      "Flow AIは、売上・来店・購買率などの店舗データと、\nマニュアル・SOP・店舗報告を参照しながら、\n状況確認、要因整理、次の打ち手の検討を支援します。"
    
    ### 3. Right Column Layout (Mock UI Feature Card)
    The right element is contained within a large white multi-layered interface block designed to look like a clean interactive card window.
    - **Parent Card Styling:** 
      - Background: Ultra-soft, off-white or light gray background card wash.
      - Border: A very thin, light gray outer stroke.
      - Shape: Rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
      - Spacing: Substantial internal padding to isolate the inner chat blocks.
    
    - **Card Header Group:** Features a horizontal flex layout containing:
      - A subtle 4-point sparkle line-art SVG icon in an accent green color.
      - A vertical text cluster: Title text reading "Flow AI" (Bold, prominent, dark navy) and smaller description text reading "店舗運営について質問できます" (Muted gray text).
    
    - **Inner Chat Block Rows:** A vertical stack of 3 individual message containers. Each container must be a separate card row with a pure white background, smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 12px), an ultra-faint gray border, and embedded flex items:
      - **Left Asset:** A small, rounded light gray or green-outlined container housing a custom line-art SVG icon matching the context (Data Bar Chart icon for row 1, Search/Magnifying Glass icon for row 2, Target/Gear circle icon for row 3).
      - **Right Content:** A vertical text grouping containing an olive-green label and bold dark-navy quote copy exactly as follows:
        - **Row 1 Label:** 状況を聞く  |  **Row 1 Quote:** 「今日、売上目標に届くために何を優先すべきですか？」
        - **Row 2 Label:** 理由を聞く  |  **Row 2 Quote:** 「来店数はあるのに購買率が低い理由は何ですか？」
        - **Row 3 Label:** 次の打ち手を聞く  |  **Row 3 Quote:** 「接客・VMD・スタッフ配置のどこを見直すべきですか？」
    
    - **Card Footer Tag List:** A thin divider separator or spacing block followed by a bottom horizontal flex wrap section containing:
      - **Label:** An inline database icon followed by text reading "参照データ" (Dark navy/black text).
      - **Pill Tags System:** A row of light gray pill blocks with soft rounded corners, light gray background fills, and tiny crisp black font text: "売上", "来店", "購買率", "Pulse", "SOP", "メモ", and a trailing multi-dot option icon button ("...").
    
    ### 4. Liquid Schema & Custom CSS Requirements
    - Make all titles, content, badge text, and the row quotes completely editable by mapping them to appropriate text, textarea, and block loops inside the section schema settings.
    - All custom CSS styles must be tightly scoped using the `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}` handle to guarantee absolutely zero layout or style leaking across your theme.
    - Ensure the right interface card scales cleanly down on tablet or mobile dimensions without any inner text overflowing or cutting off.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px 0;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    width: fit-content;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 42px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-header-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-rows-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.chat_row_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.chat_row_border }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.chat_icon_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.chat_icon_border }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tags-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tag_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_text_color }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-more-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-split-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-split-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-split-feature-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.badge_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-split-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-split-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-split-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-split-feature-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg class="ai-split-feature-card-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2L15 8L22 9L17 14L18 21L12 18L6 21L7 14L2 9L9 8L12 2Z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="ai-split-feature-card-header-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-split-feature-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_title }}</h3>
              <p class="ai-split-feature-card-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_subtitle }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-rows-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.row_1_label != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
                    <path d="M3 9h18"/>
                    <path d="M9 21V9"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_1_label }}</p>
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_1_quote }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.row_2_label != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
                    <path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_2_label }}</p>
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_2_quote }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.row_3_label != blank %}
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_3_label }}</p>
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.row_3_quote }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <div class="ai-split-feature-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

          <div class="ai-split-feature-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-split-feature-footer-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg class="ai-split-feature-footer-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/>
                <line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/>
              </svg>
              {{ block.settings.footer_label }}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-split-feature-tags-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.tag_1 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_1 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.tag_2 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_2 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.tag_3 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_3 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.tag_4 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_4 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.tag_5 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_5 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.tag_6 != blank %}
                <span class="ai-split-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tag_6 }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              <svg class="ai-split-feature-more-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"/>
                <circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"/>
                <circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AiSplitFeature{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('ai-split-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AiSplitFeature{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

